  "job_B21.2.1.3.1_20251003_114550": {
    "text": "Wi\u00fe heafod ece & wi\u00fe ealdum heafod ece & wi\u00fe healfes heafdes ece.\nWi\u00fe aswollenum eagum & god eah sealf & wi\u00f0 miste on eagan & wi\u00f0 flie & wi\u00f0 wyrmum on eagum &\nWi\u00fe earw\u00e6rce & wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6m gif wyrmas syn on earan & god ear sealf.\nWi\u00fe to\u00fe ece & gif te\u00fe syn hole.\nWi\u00fe innan tobrocenum mu\u00f0e.\nWi\u00fe ceocadle & wi\u00fe ceolw\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe heals w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe bite.\nWi\u00fe hwostan.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam \u00fee mon blode hr\u00e6ce.\nWi\u00fe seondum geallan.\nWi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re geolwan adle.\nWi\u00fe breost w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe hwostan & wi\u00fe lungenadle.\nWi\u00fe magan w\u00e6rce & wi\u00fe a\u00feundenesse.\nWi\u00f0 milt w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe linden w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe wambe w\u00e6rce & rysel w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe bl\u00e6dder w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif man ne m\u00e6ge gemigan & \u00feam men \u00fee stanas weaxan on \u00fe\u00e6re bl\u00e6dran.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif men sie se utgang forseten.\nWi\u00fe utsihtadle drenc & briw.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam wyrmum \u00fee beo\u00fe on mannes inno\u00fee.\nWi\u00fe li\u00f0 w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe weartum.\nWi\u00f0 \u00feam miclan lice smiring & b\u00e6\u00fe & drenc & briw.\nWi\u00fe singalum \u00feurste untrumra manna.\nWi\u00fe innan fortoge & sm\u00e6l \u00feearma ece.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam \u00fee man sie mid fyre anum forb\u00e6rned & wi\u00fe \u00feam \u00fee man sie mid w\u00e6tan forb\u00e6rned & wi\u00fe\nWi\u00fe \u00feeore drenc & eft wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re & sceotendum wenne & eft be\u00feing wi\u00fe \u00feam gif \u00feeor gewunige on anre\nWi\u00fe wenne sealf.\nWi\u00fe dolge sealf.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif man sie ufan on heafod wund & sie ban gebrocen & wi\u00fe \u00feam gif sio eaxl upstige & god\nWi\u00fe hundes slite & wi\u00fe \u00feon gif sinwe forcorfene & wi\u00fe \u00feam gif sinwe sien gescruncene.\nWi\u00fe gongewifran bite.\nWi\u00fe cancre.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam \u00fee wif ne m\u00e6ge bearn acennan & gif of wife nelle gan \u00e6fter \u00feam beor\u00fere \u00fe\u00e6t gecyndelic sie\nWi\u00fe \u00feam \u00fee wifum sie forstanden hira mona\u00f0 gecynd & wi\u00fe \u00feam gif wife to swi\u00fee offlowe sio mono\u00fe\nWi\u00fe smeagea wyrme smiring & anlegen & be\u00feing & sealf.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam \u00fee man sie mona\u00feseoc.\nWi\u00fe ealle feondes costunga drenc & sealf, wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan & hu man scyle gewitseocne man lacnian &\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif swi\u00fedrenc on men gesittan & he nelle utgan.\nWi\u00fe attres drence.\nWi\u00fe lusum.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif \u00feorn stinge mon on fot o\u00f0\u00f0e hreod & \u00feonne nelle ofgan.\nWi\u00fe \u00e6sm\u00e6lum & wi\u00fe eallum eagna w\u00e6rce.\nWi\u00fe lyft adle gif se mu\u00fe sie woh o\u00fe\u00fee won l\u00e6cedom & be\u00feing & b\u00e6\u00fe sealf & leah & blodes l\u00e6s.\nWi\u00fe ficadle drenc & be\u00feing.\nWi\u00fe sculdor w\u00e6rce & earma.\nWi\u00fe cneowa sare.\nWi\u00fe fota sare.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif \u00feu ne m\u00e6ge blod dolg forwri\u00fean.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif meoloc sie gewerd.\nWi\u00fe niht gengean sealf.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif men beo sio heafod panne gehlenced.\nWi\u00f0 \u00feam gif men nelle meltan his mete.\nWi\u00fe wif gem\u00e6dlan.\nWi\u00fe feondes costunga.\nWi\u00fe \u00feeor wenne gif he sie men on cneowe o\u00fe\u00fee on o\u00ferum lime.\nBe \u00feam hu mon scyle ear sealfe wyrcean.\nWi\u00fe \u00e6lfcynne sealf & wi\u00fe niht gengan & \u00feam monnum \u00fee deofol mid h\u00e6m\u00f0.\nWi\u00fe \u00e6lfadle l\u00e6cedom & eft hu mon sceal on \u00fea wyrte singan \u00e6r hi mon nime & eft hu mon sceal \u00fea\nTacnu hu \u00feu meaht ongitan hw\u00e6\u00feer mon sie on w\u00e6ter\u00e6lfadle & l\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe \u00feam & gealdor on to\nWi\u00f0 deofle li\u00fee drenc & ungemynde & wi\u00fe deofles costunga.\nWi\u00fe \u00feon gif mon sie gegymed & tacnu hw\u00e6\u00feer he libban m\u00e6ge.\nDrenc wi\u00fe \u00feam gif \u00feeor sie on men.\nWi\u00fe deofle seoce & wi\u00fe deofle.\nWi\u00fe weden heorte leoht drenc.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif men sie maga asurod & for\u00feunden & wi\u00fe magan w\u00e6rce & gif man bi\u00fe a\u00feunden.\nWi\u00fe wambe w\u00e6rce & wi\u00fe magan w\u00e6rce & wi\u00fe wambe heardnesse.\nWi\u00fe springe smiring & sealf.\nWi\u00fe attre drenc & smiring.\nWi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re geolwan adle.\nWi\u00fe \u00feam gif innelfe si ute.\nWi\u00fe \u00e6lcre innan untrymnesse & wi\u00fe hefignesse & wi\u00fe hleorbl\u00e6ce.\nBe \u00feam hu man scyle halige sealfe wyrcean.",
